00:02:14.919 --> 00:02:16.854
<i>I don't know maybe,</i>


00:02:16.888 --> 00:02:19.991
<i>maybe... maybe I should just...</i>


00:02:20.024 --> 00:02:22.459
<i>give it a go,
set up my own shop.</i>


