00:25:10.828 --> 00:25:11.896
Right here, on my system.


00:25:11.929 --> 00:25:13.931
Well, it's wrong.
Check it again.


00:25:13.964 --> 00:25:16.267
Home use of the archive


00:25:16.300 --> 00:25:19.803
