00:33:48.746 --> 00:33:50.748
Hello.


00:33:50.782 --> 00:33:52.416
Sorry.


00:33:52.449 --> 00:33:54.118
No, don't say sorry.
It's my fault.


00:33:54.152 --> 00:33:58.388
Uh, work's been progressing so quickly I
