fully independent.


00:34:12.737 --> 00:34:15.405
No tethers, no battery, nothing.


00:34:18.642 --> 00:34:20.343
Days?


00:34:20.377 --> 00:34:22.412
Yeah, days. I promise.


00:34:26.283 --> 00:34:28.418
