00:45:07.958 --> 00:45:10.427
- Yeah, I go that part.
- This involves her.


00:45:19.436 --> 00:45:20.437
Hmm.


00:45:35.252 --> 00:45:36.320
Two night ago.


00:45:38.055 --> 00:45:39.657
You were in my house?


00:45:39.691 --> 00:45:41.291
- It was sent to me.
